  unitName: Sun Tse
  unitId: 810918
  unitNumber: 8631
  description: A war general from a world in turmoil that came to be known as the
    "Little Conqueror." After inheriting his father's great legacy at a young age,
    he used his own great might to befriend other powerful military generals, adding
    their forces to his ranks and expanding his influence even further. Said to be
    a very handsome and open-minded man, he charmed many who were elated to enter
    his service. His drive to build the foundations of his nation was such that he
    did not even hesitate to face his closest friend in battle for the sake of his
    cause.
  summonDesc: I have no interest in simpletons! I go straight for the lion's head,
    easy as that! Crush them all in a single blow!
  fusionDesc: It is almost a pity that you are sharing so much of your power with
    me. Leave some for the rest too, understood?
  evoDesc: Come, the battle waits for no one!<br>For honor and glory!
  element: 1
  rarity: 7
